---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<style></style>

<BaseLayout>
    <div
        class="shadow-md border-2 border-gray-200 bg-white rounded-lg h-15 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 whitespace-nowrap
                    dark:bg-slate-700 dark:text-gray-100 dark:border-gray-300 transition-colors"
    >
        English version available at <a
            class="ml-1 underline decoration-wavy flex flex-row"
            href="/en/colophon"
            >here <svg
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                width="24"
                height="24"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
                <path d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"></path>
                <path
                    fill="currentColor"
                    d="M10.768 5.25h2.464c.813 0 1.469 0 2 .043c.546.045 1.026.14 1.47.366a3.75 3.75 0 0 1 1.64 1.639c.226.444.32.924.365 1.47c.043.531.043 1.187.043 2v2.464c0 .813 0 1.469-.043 2c-.045.546-.14 1.026-.366 1.47a3.75 3.75 0 0 1-1.639 1.64c-.444.226-.924.32-1.47.365c-.531.043-1.187.043-2 .043h-3.61c-2.005 0-3.01-2.424-1.592-3.841l4.41-4.409h-1.565a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h3.375a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.375a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-1.564L9.091 15.97a.75.75 0 0 0 .53 1.28H13.2c.853 0 1.447 0 1.91-.038c.453-.038.714-.107.912-.207c.423-.216.767-.56.983-.983c.1-.198.17-.459.207-.913c.037-.462.038-1.056.038-1.909v-2.4c0-.852 0-1.447-.038-1.91c-.038-.453-.107-.714-.207-.911a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-.983-.984c-.198-.1-.459-.17-.913-.207c-.462-.037-1.056-.038-1.909-.038h-2.4c-.852 0-1.447 0-1.91.038c-.453.037-.714.107-.911.207a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-.984.984c-.1.197-.17.458-.207.912c-.037.462-.038 1.057-.038 1.909v2.7a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.732c0-.813 0-1.469.043-2c.045-.546.14-1.026.366-1.47a3.75 3.75 0 0 1 1.639-1.64c.444-.226.924-.32 1.47-.365c.531-.043 1.187-.043 2-.043"
                ></path>
            </svg>
        </a>.
    </div>
    <div
        data-home-lang="zh-hant"
        class="flex flex-col gap-4 lg:text-lg md:text-md w-full text-left dark:text-gray-100 transition-colors mt-3"
    >
        <p>
            Hi! 歡迎來到Colophon頁。於此小弟希望簡單談談我是如何製作這個網頁的。
        </p>
        <p>
            小弟會談及很多細節，故你可以只讀基本資訊
            (TLDR)一部份。餘下的就姑且當是我想和你講的故事吧。
        </p>
        <p class="text-3xl underline">基本資訊 (TLDR)</p>
        <p>
            本頁面以astro.js作為主要框架。astro.js為一個靜態網頁框架，且非常適合製作部落格。本頁之域名smkpdl.dev購自Spaceship，託管於Netlify的免費方案上。
        </p>
        <p class="text-3xl underline">為什麼製作這個版本?</p>
        <p>
            So actually, before this page, I have like, 3 different versions of
            my website. The 1st and 2nd version did not use any framework and is
            just a simple mix of HTML, CSS and JavaScript. However, A major
            disadvantage is that I cannot write blogs in md format. This is a
            bit tricky. Along that, old pages did not use any framework, and is
            somehow a great disadvantage for finding jobs.
        </p>
        <p>
            So we have the 3rd version of the page. It uses Astro.js as
            framework, the same as the current version. However, I procastinated
            a lot and did not put too much effort in maintaining that page due
            to the stress of finding jobs. The page looks rather incompleted,
            with no blog posts at all. With that website I totally lose
            motivation in making blogs.
        </p>
        <p>
            After I get a job, the idea of "completing" the website has arised.
            This at least includes adding different languages and also making a
            dark theme. Also, since the previous Astro.js version is developed
            based on a template, hence I have lot more limitations in developing
            to the way I love. So this is why I need a new version. Not only to
            build my favourite design, but also, a site that I would like to
            write things on.
        </p>
        <p class="text-3xl underline">How you design?</p>
        <p>
            It's a really long progress. With the effect of procastination, I
            spend a lot of times designing the draft. I just simply draw them on
            a notebook, step by step and then continuously design the page until
            I get something I really like. After I started coding, most of the
            things are designed on-the-fly, in which I just to plenty of
            trial-and-errors and finalize the design.
        </p>
        <p class="text-3xl underline">Any features?</p>
        <p>
            In the beginning, I have decided to make my website no-javascript
            friendly. In my opinion, a blog page should be a static page that do
            not consume too much server resources, and there is actually no
            reason for a blog page to be non-static. So even though astro.js
            supports framework, I still decided not to put any. With my testing,
            a non-javascript users can also have a similar experience as a
            javascript-enabled user.
        </p>
        <p>
            Moreover, this page tried its best to follow WCAG 2.2 Level AA
            standards. Several features have been implemented to make the page
            more accesible, including the color schemes and screen-reader
            friendly texts.
        </p>
        <p class="text-3xl underline">Design?</p>
        <p>
            Font: For font I have been using Huninn. It is a open-sourced
            rounded font that provides good experience for both Chinese and
            English. Moreover, it has a great support over special characters
            that are commonly used in Hong Kong, Macau and Taiwan.
        </p>
        <p>
            Color Scheme: Two color schemes: Light and Dark, just like most
            usual websites. The colors are picked such that the contrast between
            text and background satisfies WCAG 2.2 Level AA requirements.
        </p>
        <p class="text-3xl underline">AI declaration</p>
        <p>Not yet since the site is not completed</p>

        <p class="text-3xl underline">To-dos?</p>
        <p>Not yet since the site is not completed</p>

        <p class="text-3xl underline">Changelogs?</p>
        <p>Aug 2026: First commit made.</p>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
